\n\n| |第一季度|第二季度|第三季度|第四季度|\n| ---|---|---|---|---|\n| 营业收入|3,308,640,285.35|17,393,488,964.30|27,584,043,546.48|27,072,785,205.73|\n| 归属于上市公司股东的净利润|156,494,308.41|756,329,709.24|1,256,306,602.29|1,263,159,232.02|\n| 归属于上市公司股东的扣除非经常性损益的净利润|129,187,055.93|725,395,021.35|1,255,017,314.43|1,195,494,379.68|\n| 经营活动产生的现金流量净额|2,093,122,907.01|-9,757,045,919.65|3,632,404,813.60|1,489,340,662.", "chunk_index": 5, "date": ""}, {"title": "CF-2025-ANNUAL-SUMMARY.pdf", "url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "source": "本地知识库", "snippet": "Bf4o3MUwcPuErcabaLqoE0Nn14arB%2FF6lPqfn6mbhgs%2FbImsGtk0wQePlPVDRfr0NSPAUKcgnAFqHaFd6TUxylurgEZkP6CM4VL1ivlRKYCjswq0IBmNEWQEU%2BAMVJ1q6EzKmtxab7%2Fq8Y3zRbrTHKue7uDTzp593Qs%2FqVZvdUBxqAAaEif0rDt4aHEqkJalE1gFiqsb5odcK69JUfjkocm9BcXSIskg0Okot%2Fl0Wgf%2BqorxHTnCeN1DIAigRw8W%2FXGXkfUI2AHN%2FUyYvBU8tZMY0hEa6HZW57bHXGbaee5vra02UFhYLw2Y%2BS8MJyzn1uostBBYoPpxHuIr%2F4p3Mx048OIAA%3D)  \n\n\n# 5、在年度报告批准报出日存续的债券情况  \n\n\n□适用 口不适用  \n\n\n# 三、重要事项  \n\n\n无", "original_text": "Bf4o3MUwcPuErcabaLqoE0Nn14arB%2FF6lPqfn6mbhgs%2FbImsGtk0wQePlPVDRfr0NSPAUKcgnAFqHaFd6TUxylurgEZkP6CM4VL1ivlRKYCjswq0IBmNEWQEU%2BAMVJ1q6EzKmtxab7%2Fq8Y3zRbrTHKue7uDTzp593Qs%2FqVZvdUBxqAAaEif0rDt4aHEqkJalE1gFiqsb5odcK69JUfjkocm9BcXSIskg0Okot%2Fl0Wgf%2BqorxHTnCeN1DIAigRw8W%2FXGXkfUI2AHN%2FUyYvBU8tZMY0hEa6HZW57bHXGbaee5vra02UFhYLw2Y%2BS8MJyzn1uostBBYoPpxHuIr%2F4p3Mx048OIAA%3D)  \n\n\n# 5、在年度报告批准报出日存续的债券情况  \n\n\n□适用 口不适用  \n\n\n# 三、重要事项  \n\n\n无", "chunk_index": 15, "date": ""}], "extracted_facts": [{"content": "中航成飞2025年分季度营业收入为Q1 3,308,640,285.35元、Q2 17,393,488,964.30元、Q3 27,584,043,546.48元、Q4 27,072,785,205.73元；Q3为全年最高，Q4次高，Q1最低。", "source_name": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（公告编号2026-009）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "credibility": 0.98}, {"content": "根据分季度营业收入加总，2025年全年营业收入约75,358,958,001.86元（753.59亿元）；Q1/Q2/Q3/Q4占比分别约4.39%、23.08%、36.60%、35.93%，Q3占比最高。", "source_name": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（公告编号2026-009）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "credibility": 0.98}, {"content": "2025年分季度归母净利润Q1 156,494,308.41元、Q2 756,329,709.24元、Q3 1,256,306,602.29元、Q4 1,263,159,232.02元；Q4最高，Q3次高。", "source_name": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（公告编号2026-009）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "credibility": 0.98}, {"content": "2025年分季度扣非归母净利润Q1 129,187,055.93元、Q2 725,395,021.35元、Q3 1,255,017,314.43元、Q4 1,195,494,379.68元；Q3最高。", "source_name": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（公告编号2026-009）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "credibility": 0.98}, {"content": "中航成飞主营业务为航空产品研发、制造、销售、维修与服务保障，主要产品包括航空防务装备、民用航空产品和智能测控产品。", "source_name": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（公告编号2026-009）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "credibility": 0.98}], "data_points": [{"name": "2025年第一季度扣非归母净利润", "value": "129,187,055.93", "unit": "元", "year": "2025年第一季度", "source": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（公告编号2026-009）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "source_id": "439a3ec2d3341e3a3ce9d9e1", "source_quote": "| 归属于上市公司股东的扣除非经常性损益的净利润|129,187,055.93|725,395,021.35|1,255,017,314.43|1,195,494,379.68|"}, {"name": "2025年第二季度扣非归母净利润", "value": "725,395,021.35", "unit": "元", "year": "2025年第二季度", "source": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（公告编号2026-009）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "source_id": "439a3ec2d3341e3a3ce9d9e1", "source_quote": "| 归属于上市公司股东的扣除非经常性损益的净利润|129,187,055.93|725,395,021.35|1,255,017,314.43|1,195,494,379.68|"}, {"name": "2025年第三季度扣非归母净利润", "value": "1,255,017,314.43", "unit": "元", "year": "2025年第三季度", "source": "中航成飞2025年年度报告摘要（公告编号2026-009）", "source_url": "local://kb/kb_6bf4f0b4/b5655f62427ec0232490e64a1691f27e", "source_id": "439a3ec2d3341e3a3ce9d9e1", "source_quote": "| 归属于上市公司股东的扣除非经常性损益的净利润|129,187,055.93|725,395,021.35|1,255,017,314.43|1,195,494,379.68|"}, {"name": "2025年第四季度扣非归母净利润", "value": "1,195,494,379.68", "unit": "元", "year": "2025年第四季度", "source": "中